{"word":"ἐθέλω","uri":"ethelô","senses":[{"word":"ἐθέλω","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἐθέλω</span></span> (<span class=\"ital\">impf.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"êthelon\">ἤθελον</span>,</span> <span class=\"ital\">f.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self>ἐθελήσω</span>,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ao.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self>ἠθέλησα</span>,</span> <span class=\"ital\">pf.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self>ἠθέληκα</span>,</span> <span class=\"ital\">pl. q.\npf.</span> <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self>ἠθελήκειν</span></span>) <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"thelô\">θέλω</span></span> (<span class=\"ital\">en poésie, dans la langue familière, dans les loc. d’usage\ncourant, dans les proverbes ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">v. en outre\nfin de l’article</span>) vouloir, <span class=\"ital\">c. à d.</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> vouloir bien, consentir\nà, <span class=\"ital\">avec l’inf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 2, 14 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 1, 49,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">abs.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 1, 3 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">au participe</span> <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-entries=\"ho_(1),tên\">τὴν</span> <span data-linked-entries=\"d,de\">δ’</span>\n<span data-linked-self>ἐθέλων</span> <span data-linked-self>ἐθέλουσαν</span> <a href=\"/anagô\">ἀνήγαγεν</a>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">3, 272,</span> il l’emmena, de leur\nconsentement mutuel ; <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self>ἐθέλων</span></span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-sel