n class=\"refch\">9, 30 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">10, 35 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><a href=\"/ei_(1)\">εἰ</a></span> : <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-self data-linked-alternatives=\"thelêsis\">θελήσεις</span> <a href=\"/ei_(1)\">εἰ</a>\n<a href=\"/mê\">μὴ</a> <a href=\"/gennaô-ô\">ἐγεννήθης</a>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Spt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Sir.</span> <span class=\"refch\">23, 19,</span> tu\nsouhaiteras de n’avoir jamais été engendré ; <span class=\"ital\">avec une prop. inf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">19, 274 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 3 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec</span>\n<span class=\"grec\"><a href=\"/hôste\">ὥστε</a>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Hipp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1327 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">avec un acc.</span> <span class=\"grec\">θ.\n<a href=\"/tis_(2)\">τι</a>,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Suppl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">740 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 50,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> vouloir qqe ch. ; <span class=\"grec\"><span data-linked-entries=\"ti_(1),ti_(2),tis_(1),tis_(2)\">τί</span> <a href=\"/dê_(1)\">δὴ</a>\n<span data-linked-self>θέλων</span>;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">118,</span> dans quelle\nintention ? (<span class=\"ital\">litt.</span> voulant quoi ?) ;\n<span class=\"ital\">qqf.</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec un acc. qui\npeut dépendre d’un verbe s. e. :</span> <span class=\"grec\"><a href=\"/phrazô\">φράζεαι</a>, <a href=\"/hostis\">ἅσσ’</a> <span data-linked-self>ἐθέλῃσθα</span></span> (<span class=\"ital\">s.\ne.</span> <span class=\"grec\"><a href=\"/phrazô\">φράζεσθαι</a></span>) <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 554,</span> dis ce